# Product Context

## Problem Definition
Developers need to work within VSCode while simultaneously building and testing web applications. Maintaining consistency between the backend and frontend during this process is challenging.

## Solution Approach
Automatically generate backend and frontend code based on OpenAPI specifications to ensure consistency, and apply Domain-Driven Design (DDD) and CQRS patterns to build a scalable backend.

## User Experience Goals
1. Enable application development and testing directly within VSCode
2. Maintain consistent data models between backend and frontend
3. Provide an intuitive, component-based UI development experience
4. Simplify API development and testing workflows